---
// src/pages/en/terms.astro
// Institutional & User Terms of Service (ToS) & Acceptable Use Policy (AUP)
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="alternate icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Institutional & User Terms of Service (ToS) & AUP | ColabEdu.net</title>
    <meta name="description" content="ColabEdu Terms of Service and Acceptable Use Policy (AUP): 100% Student/Teacher/School IP Ownership, Zero AI Model Training, Human-in-the-Loop teacher authority, and Open OER licenses.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style is:global>
        :root {
            --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            background-color: #FAF9F6;
            color: #0F172A;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .precision-card {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <Header lang="en" currentPath="/en/terms" />

    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-10">
        <section class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
                <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 text-teal-800 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                    COLABEDU-LEGAL-TOS-AUP-EN-v2.0 · Effective Nov 19, 2026
                </span>
                <a href="/legal/ColabEdu-Terms-of-Service-and-AUP-EN.pdf" download class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-teal-700 text-white text-xs font-bold hover:bg-teal-800 transition">
                    Download Official PDF &darr;
                </a>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900">
                Institutional &amp; User Terms of Service (ToS) &amp; Acceptable Use Policy (AUP)
            </h1>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Governing individual, family, and institutional use of the ColabEdu ecosystem.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="precision-card p-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">1. 100% Student, Educator, and School Intellectual Property Ownership</h2>
            <p>
                Students, Educators, and/or their Educational Institutions retain <strong>100% ownership and all intellectual property rights</strong> in and to all student submissions, essays, problem solutions, oral recordings, handwritten scans, teacher recipe variants (<code>AuthorityScope.TEACHER</code> / <code>SCHOOL</code>), and classroom evaluation directives (<code>AssignmentOverrides</code>). ColabEdu contractually covenants that it shall <strong>never</strong> use customer or student submissions to train foundational AI models or to serve targeted advertising.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 pt-4">2. Pedagogical Governance &amp; Educator Final Authority (Human-in-the-Loop)</h2>
            <p>
                In classroom deployments, ColabEdu operates strictly as an educator copilot (EU AI Act Art. 14). All scores and rubric feedback generated by <code>Grading V2</code> are assistive drafts: educators retain full authority to calibrate (<code>CALIBRATION_LIGHT</code>), curve (<code>GradeCurvingService</code>), manually override any score, or control feedback section visibility (<code>reportVisibility</code>) before publishing grades to the LMS gradebook. Practice exam score estimates (College Board AP, IB, State Assessments, PAU/EBAU) are strictly formative.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 pt-4">3. Open Educational Resources (OER), AI Compute Memberships &amp; Safe Space</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
                <li><strong>Open OER Catalog:</strong> Open Educational Resources are distributed under their respective open licenses (CC BY 4.0, CC BY-SA, CC BY-NC-SA, or Public Domain) with full attribution to canonical sources (OpenStax, LibreTexts, CEDEC/INTEF, Marea Verde).</li>
                <li><strong>Multi-Entity Billing &amp; 14-Day Refund Guarantee:</strong> US, Canadian, Mexican, and Americas customers contract in US Dollars (<code>USD $</code>) with <strong>Healthcentrix Inc. DBA ColabEdu US</strong>; EEA customers contract in Euros (<code>EUR €</code>) with <strong>ColabEdu S.L.</strong> Direct B2C subscriptions include a 14-day money-back guarantee and one-click cancellation.</li>
                <li><strong>Private Home Study Safe Space:</strong> Home practice sessions (<code>SAFE_SPACE_PRIVATE</code>) are architecturally isolated from school LMS gradebooks.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 pt-4">4. School &amp; User Acceptable Use Policy (AUP)</h2>
            <p>
                Users agree to use the Socratic Companion and interactive simulators for constructive learning, keep <strong>Anonymous Classroom Mode (Zero-PII Roster)</strong> active in schools without a centralized district LTI integration, and refrain from reverse engineering, automated bulk scraping of inference APIs, or uploading unlawful content.
            </p>

            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Legal &amp; district inquiries: <a href="mailto:legal@colabedu.org" class="text-teal-700 font-bold underline">legal@colabedu.org</a></span>
                <div class="flex gap-3">
                    <a href="/en/privacy" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-semibold text-xs hover:bg-slate-50 transition">Privacy Policy</a>
                    <a href="/en/trust" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white font-semibold text-xs hover:bg-slate-800 transition">Trust &amp; Compliance Pack</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <Footer lang="en" />
</body>
</html>
